<template name="rr-mine"><view wx:if="{{r.mine&&r.mine.visible}}" class="rr-card rr-mine"><view class="rr-heading"><yx-icon name="gift" tone="brand" size="38"/><text>{{r.mine.title}}</text><text wx:if="{{r.mine.invitee_paid}}" class="rr-pill">新人礼已到账</text></view><view wx:if="{{r.mine.invitee_paid&&r.mine.invitee_coins!==null}}" class="rr-amount">+{{r.mine.invitee_coins}}<text>金币 · 新人奖励</text></view><view wx:elif="{{r.mine.state==='waiting_sign'&&r.mine.invitee_coins!==null&&r.mine.invitee_coins>0}}" class="rr-amount">{{r.mine.invitee_coins}}<text>金币 · 首次签到后核验</text></view><text class="rr-copy" wx:if="{{r.mine.canSign}}">已签到 {{r.mine.signed_days===null?'—':r.mine.signed_days}} / {{r.mine.required_days===null?'—':r.mine.required_days}} 个自然日；达标后核验邀请人礼遇。</text><text class="rr-copy" wx:else>奖励按本次参与记录及真实金币流水核验，正常签到与使用不受影响。</text><text wx:if="{{r.mine.expires}}" class="rr-small">本次参与截止 {{r.mine.expires}}</text><text wx:if="{{r.error}}" class="rr-error">{{r.error}}</text><view class="rr-links"><button wx:if="{{r.mine.canSign}}" bindtap="goReferralSign">去每日签到 ›</button><button bindtap="goRewardRecords">查看奖励进度 ›</button></view></view></template>
<template name="rr-summary"><view class="rr-card"><view class="rr-heading"><yx-icon name="coin" tone="brand" size="38"/><text>我的邀请收益</text><button wx:if="{{!detail}}" bindtap="goRewardRecords">明细 ›</button></view><view class="rr-totals"><view><text>{{r.inviter.earned===null?'—':r.inviter.earned}}</text><text>已到账金币</text></view><view><text>{{r.inviter.pending_coins===null?'—':r.inviter.pending_coins}}</text><text>待达标金币</text></view></view><text class="rr-small">仅统计真实奖励记录，待达标不计入余额。</text><block wx:if="{{r.campaign}}"><view class="rr-rule-head">{{r.campaign.name}}</view><view class="rr-rule-pair"><view><text>{{r.campaign.inviter_points}}</text><text>邀请人礼遇 · 金币</text></view><view><text>{{r.campaign.invitee_points}}</text><text>新朋友礼遇 · 金币</text></view></view><text class="rr-copy">新朋友首次签到后核验新人礼；在注册起 {{r.campaign.window_days}} 个自然日内累计 {{r.campaign.min_sign_days}} 个不同自然日签到后，核验直属邀请人礼遇。</text><text class="rr-copy">{{r.campaign.rules_text||'仅限活动期内有效新用户，名额及资格以后台确认为准；不要求观看或点击广告。'}}</text><text wx:if="{{r.campaign.ends}}" class="rr-small">新参与截止 {{r.campaign.ends}}</text></block><text wx:else class="rr-copy">当前未开放新的奖励参与；已确认的参与按原记录核验，历史已到账奖励仍可查询。</text><view class="rr-links"><button bindtap="refreshReferral" disabled="{{r.loading}}">{{r.loading?'同步中':'刷新奖励状态'}}</button></view><text wx:if="{{r.error}}" class="rr-error">{{r.error}}</text></view></template>
<template name="rr-records"><yx-state wx:if="{{r.loading&&!r.loaded}}" type="loading" title="正在核对奖励记录"/><yx-state wx:elif="{{r.error&&!r.loaded}}" type="error" title="奖励记录暂未加载" description="{{r.error}}" action="重新加载" bindaction="refreshReferral"/><block wx:elif="{{r.loaded}}"><yx-state wx:if="{{!r.records.length}}" type="empty" title="还没有奖励记录" description="仅符合活动资格的真实参与会出现在这里。"/><view wx:for="{{r.records}}" wx:key="id" class="rr-record"><view><text>{{item.title}}</text><text>{{item.member_label}}</text><text wx:if="{{item.time}}">{{item.time}}</text><text wx:if="{{!item.paid&&item.required_days!==null&&item.signed_days!==null}}">签到进度 {{item.signed_days}} / {{item.required_days}} 天</text></view><view><text class="{{item.paid?'rr-paid':''}}">{{item.paid?'+':''}}{{item.coins}} 金币</text><text>{{item.status}}</text></view></view><text wx:if="{{r.error}}" class="rr-error">{{r.error}}</text><button wx:if="{{r.has_more}}" class="ui-text-button" bindtap="moreRewards" disabled="{{r.loading}}" loading="{{r.loading}}">加载更多奖励记录</button></block></template>
